Error [jet.MarkerGeneratesOutsideRow]: `Loud`'s template writes declarations, but its row has no `Meta.Generate`
  --> tests/ui/effects/lint_generates_outside_row_is_e0775.jet:14:1
    |
 14 | #Loud
    | ^^^^^
 Why: A template whose row is `-[]>` only reads the program, so it may reject or warn but not add code
 Fix: Write `-[Meta.Generate]>` on `Loud`'s `expand`, or remove the declarations its template writes
